<p>Executes a script.
</p>
<div class="dascript" style="font-family:monospace; background-color:#F9F9F9; border: 1px dashed #2F6FAB; white-space:pre; line-height:1.25em; padding:1.0em;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Void%20keyword" title="Void keyword">void</a> Deprecated_ExecuteScript(<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Resource%20keyword" title="Resource keyword">resource</a> rScript,<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Object%20keyword" title="Object keyword">object</a> oTarget<br />);</div>
